[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9540.469, "timestamp": "02:39:00", "text": "好的。我们来看看那里有什么。有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9542.309, "timestamp": "02:39:02", "text": "很多积木。如果你愿意，可以再多吃一些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9548.71, "timestamp": "02:39:08", "text": "想要几叠。我要去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9552.79, "timestamp": "02:39:12", "text": "钻石镐。好的。我要带走我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9554.63, "timestamp": "02:39:14", "text": "老的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9558.95, "timestamp": "02:39:18", "text": "是的，这很像这把弓。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9561.349, "timestamp": "02:39:21", "text": "哦，是的。无穷大"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9566.389, "timestamp": "02:39:26", "text": "还有这个。哦是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9568.96, "timestamp": "02:39:28", "text": "是的。 不。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9572.8, "timestamp": "02:39:32", "text": "不。是的。 我的天啊。哦，太好了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9579.75, "timestamp": "02:39:39", "text": "好的，那我把剑拔出来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9582.87, "timestamp": "02:39:42", "text": "好的。对，拿把剑。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9584.71, "timestamp": "02:39:44", "text": "如果你愿意，我们可以切换到创意模式。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9586.07, "timestamp": "02:39:46", "text": "但是，是的，目前，我们打算……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9590.469, "timestamp": "02:39:50", "text": "准备参加生存挑战赛。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9597.03, "timestamp": "02:39:57", "text": "跳下去。你好。我们从……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9598.79, "timestamp": "02:39:58", "text": "正门。"}]